mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Files   tickets/; pattern=*.txt
2. <each route_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Text   (input:1)
     2. Classify                Laya 0.4B; "Which team owns this ticket? tags:
                                billing, technical, account, other"
        -> { billing: 3 | technical: 4 | account: 5 | other: 6 }

     3. Template                "BILLING    {1}"
        -> 7

     4. Template                "TECHNICAL  {1}"
        -> 7

     5. Template                "ACCOUNT    {1}"
        -> 7

     6. Template                "OTHER      {1}"
     7. Template                "{1}"
3. Sort         direction=asc   # the team prefix groups the tickets
4. Join Text    separator="\n\n---\n\n"
5. Save Text    routed-tickets.md
